target_id":"17f7-26bb-8ffe-454e"},{"link_uuid":"003a4867-5b12-48ab-8a66-4d3a06b97b1a","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"fb37-2d31-2846-4219"},{"link_uuid":"d6e67f61-8645-4a3f-a8c4-fe22d74d2870","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"3f18-e47f-af85-43ec"},{"link_uuid":"a54c7a93-c07b-4f90-ab5c-ea88655abbe2","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"ddf9-745c-1563-4da7"},{"link_uuid":"9b002e5a-6185-45dc-b425-32b4941bcb7a","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"80f8-bd7a-a92c-42eb"},{"link_uuid":"c6b39934-7f6e-4f9c-b8e1-6041699da800","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"a6a2-3ab3-6811-4a13"},{"link_uuid":"043a18aa-7082-4a9e-9c21-62a5833ed1df","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"930a-3f17-b6c0-4778"},{"link_uuid":"ce748770-4f1d-43f2-ad29-33cb5d77e29e","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"c215-a428-a18b-4cf8"},{"link_uuid":"9fb92dfb-a49d-4ed9-91ba-83541ea0708a","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"2f36-55d0-4397-4f23"},{"link_uuid":"af0103da-c7a5-4b40-85b6-98abec4931eb","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"fa12-3bff-d756-4ce2"},{"link_uuid":"12fdfcdc-2e35-4dc9-934b-12900c131643","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"09b6-4087-27f1-40e4"},{"link_uuid":"5885bb9b-7cf6-4a96-9b97-3117d04cce47","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"928d-628a-4655-46dc"},{"link_uuid":"54c18177-15a4-4d72-b8b1-2dc2e375c626","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"f565-c50f-9e66-4040"},{"link_uuid":"e0d3bb8d-2fba-49a5-b23b-09b29bc516e6","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"b8a6-731d-3844-4e18"},{"link_uuid":"f0dbb81b-7413-41a0-bc27-05bfeb7883ed","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"f2e4-b73f-5d2e-4817"},{"link_uuid":"99de0d6d-966a-4f6a-8ab9-83ad73e7345a","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"78f1-667d-6488-4388"},{"link_uuid":"8ad2cd0f-e95a-4994-acfc-9e8f10f66642","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"7968-5286-8734-485d"},{"link_uuid":"1c658b05-f2df-497b-bb8b-bc4cc349a8e7","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"b189-75bf-63b8-4424"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/unit cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_criteria_normalization.py:1-16` — Preserve effective-vocabulary precedence, synonym mapping, pass-through, and pre-routing placement. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_criteria_routing.py:1-14` — Preserve explicit routing, budget-backed posture, overlay protection, and replay-set parity. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_discovery.py:1-19` — Preserve snapshot-driven stage plan, execution facts, budget shedding, and failure resilience. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_finalize.py:1-14` — Preserve Pass-1 usage aggregation and folded-total assertion. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_fp_ledger.py:1-11, 307-311` — Preserve ledger idempotence, malformed/error behavior, non-gating telemetry, and missing-verification signal. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_gate_session.py:1-15, 149-161` — Preserve attested code/ticket snapshots and rerooted runner config. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_per_pass_classes.py:1-36, 95-101, 173-182` — Preserve exact class placement, batch-subdict trap, provider consistency, and obsolete-helper consumer guard. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_provenance_heldout_2d1c.py:1-17` — Preserve adversarial wrong-provenance/signability cases. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_provenance.py:1-14` — Preserve ref/source propagation and truthful signability provenance. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_triggers.py:1-19, 137-140, 222-229` — Preserve additive project triggers, repository root threading, and dogfood config-effect contrast. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_verifier_class.py:1-20, 173-182` — Preserve standard-class resolution, cross-provider behavior, determinism, and obsolete-helper census. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_ws2.py:65-74` — Preserve current approved blocking set, thresholds, and calibration-document pointer. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_ws4.py:22-33, 79-84, 267-275` — Preserve local-source fixture reason, explicit-operation availability, and verification persistence. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_collection_isolation_guard.py:1-18, 428-437` — Preserve inherited-root hazard, AST requirement, real collection/marker resolution, and sanctioned nested launcher. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_commit_tickets_branch_pathspec_11a9.py:1-10` — Preserve pathspec-only staging, write lock, and no-push contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_compact_all_selection.py:1-22, 244-252` — Preserve recurring selection, foldable-event/horizon convergence, honest count, and push decoupling. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_compact_crash_atomicity.py:1-21` — Preserve pre/post-fold atomicity, external intent journal, recovery scope, and inconsistent-snapshot ownership. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_compact_sweep_perf.py:1-25, 93-108, 253-261, 291-300, 383-390` — Preserve one pre-lock history walk, signed/committed fixture requirements, compatibility fallback, path-scoped staging, and `None` failure sentinel. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/test_code_review_criteria_normalization.py tests/unit/test_code_review_criteria_routing.py tests/unit/test_code_review_discovery.py tests/unit/test_code_review_finalize.py tests/unit/test_code_review_fp_ledger.py tests/unit/test_code_review_gate_session.py tests/unit/test_code_review_per_pass_classes.py tests/unit/test_code_review_provenance_heldout_2d1c.py tests/unit/test_code_review_provenance.py tests/unit/test_code_review_triggers.py tests/unit/test_code_review_verifier_class.py tests/unit/test_code_review_ws2.py tests/unit/test_code_review_ws4.py tests/unit/test_collection_isolation_guard.py tests/unit/test_commit_tickets_branch_pathspec_11a9.py tests/unit/test_compact_all_selection.py tests/unit/test_compact_crash_atomicity.py tests/unit/test_compact_sweep_perf.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/test_code_review_criteria_normalization.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_code_review_criteria_routing.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_code_review_discovery.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_code_review_finalize.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstring